{{!
    @template block_workplanner/plan_menu

    Menu to plan an activity without dragging: a day of the shown week, the later area,
    or removing the plan. It works with the keyboard and on touch screens.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-action="plan" with data-cmid, data-slot and data-day on each menu item

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cmid, name - The activity
    * isplanned - Whether the activity is planned already
    * days - Days of the shown week (from the parent context) with day, weekday and datetext

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cmid": 12, "name": "Fractions practice", "isplanned": true,
        "days": [
            {"day": 1792792800, "weekday": "Mon", "datetext": "19 October"},
            {"day": 1792879200, "weekday": "Tue", "datetext": "20 October"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="dropdown">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary block_workplanner-planbutton" data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
        aria-expanded="false" title="{{#str}}plan, block_workplanner{{/str}}">
        {{#pix}}i/calendar, core{{/pix}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}planactivity, block_workplanner, {{name}}{{/str}}</span>
    </button>
    <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end">
        {{#days}}
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="plan" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-slot="day" data-day="{{day}}">
                {{weekday}}, {{datetext}}
            </button>
        </li>
        {{/days}}
        <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="plan" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-slot="later" data-day="0">
                {{#str}}later, block_workplanner{{/str}}
            </button>
        </li>
        {{#isplanned}}
        <li>
            <button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-action="plan" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-slot="none" data-day="0">
                {{#str}}removeplan, block_workplanner{{/str}}
            </button>
        </li>
        {{/isplanned}}
    </ul>
</div>
